.SH OPTIONAL
.TP
.B
[ \fB--uri\fP uri ]
System URI e.g. '10.9.8.1:8888'
.TP
.B
[ \fB--count\fP NUM ]
Use given 'NUM' as count
.TP
.B
[ \fB--verbose\fP ]
Increase output info
.TP
.B
[ \fB--subnqn\fP STRING ]
Subsystem NQN of the NVMe over Fabrics endpoint e.g. 'nqn.2022-06.io.xnvme:ctrlnode1'
.TP
.B
[ \fB--hostnqn\fP STRING ]
The host NQN to use when connecting to NVMe over Fabrics controllers
.TP
.B
[ \fB--be\fP STRING ]
xNVMe backend, e.g. 'spdk', 'libvfn', 'upcie'
.TP
.B
[ \fB--shm_id\fP NUM ]
SPDK's spelling of \fB--homi-id\fP; the DPDK shared-memory-id
.TP
.B
[ \fB--homi-id\fP NUM ]
The HOMI identifier to share controllers under
.TP
.B
[ \fB--help\fP ]
Show usage / help
